     the request has completed.  Requests using caller-supplied storage should
     be initialized by ccrryyppttoo__iinniittrreeqq() at the start of each operation and de‐
     stroyed by ccrryyppttoo__ddeessttrrooyyrreeqq() once the request has completed.

     For ccrryyppttoo__cclloonneerreeqq(), ccrryyppttoo__ggeettrreeqq(), and ccrryyppttoo__iinniittrreeqq(), _c_s_e_s is a
